# small, hand-annotated real-webcam calibration captures and the real desk-clutter crops cut
# from them are worth keeping in git, unlike the rest of data/ (generated scenes, downloaded
# card images, checkpoints/exports), so this excludes data/'s direct children individually
# instead of the whole tree -- a bare `data/` rule would make the `!` rules below unable to
# re-include anything under them.
data/*
!data/real-captures/
!data/real-clutter-crops/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.amp/
*.log
